            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 20,
              "start": 20
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court held that the contractual non\u2011discrimination requirement imposes a burden on CSS's religious exercise and does not qualify as generally applicable, so it cannot survive strict scrutiny."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "7688ac1a239c89eb58922876b61bff2f301f0ae8683ca3d64e73b00eb6fb953d",
            "evidence_ids": [
