          "text": "The City argues that CSS\u2019s refusal to certify same\u2011sex couples violates a non\u2011discrimination provision in its contract and the Fair Practices Ordinance, which serves compelling interests such as maximizing foster\u2011parent numbers and protecting the City from liability."
        },
        {
