              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "The City maintains that it has no intention of granting an exception to CSS under \u00a7\u202f3.21, which allows discretionary exceptions at the Commissioner\u2019s sole discretion."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "City",
          "citations": [
